{"id":"7d917c014b32a7f2","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-valiant-permanent.md","title":"thm-valiant-permanent (Valiant's Permanent Theorem)","display":"thm-valiant-permanent (Valiant's Permanent Theorem)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-sharp-p]]","[[28-df-sharp-p-oracle]]"],"display":"thm-valiant-permanent (Valiant's Permanent Theorem)","label":"28-thm-valiant-permanent","type":"theorem","aliases":["28-thm-valiant-permanent","Valiant Permanent Theorem","Permanent is #P-complete"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 17.11","source_printed_pages":"347–351","source_pdf_pages":"373–377","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9470641051e0a7af\" href=\"?note=9470641051e0a7af\" title=\"28-df-sharp-p\">28-df-sharp-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed85cd72838ef590\" href=\"?note=ed85cd72838ef590\" title=\"28-df-sharp-p-oracle\">28-df-sharp-p-oracle</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-valiant-permanent (Valiant's Permanent Theorem)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-valiant-permanent"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-valiant-permanent</span><span>Valiant Permanent Theorem</span><span>Permanent is #P-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 17.11"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"347–351"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"373–377"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#\\mathbf P\">\\(\\#\\mathbf P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#\\mathbf P\\mathrm{Complete}_T\">\\(\\#\\mathbf P\\mathrm{Complete}_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9470641051e0a7af\" href=\"?note=9470641051e0a7af\" title=\"28-df-sharp-p\">28-df-sharp-p</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ed85cd72838ef590\" href=\"?note=ed85cd72838ef590\" title=\"28-df-sharp-p-oracle\">28-df-sharp-p-oracle</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=(a_{ij})_{i,j\\in[n]}\\in\\Sigma^{n\\times n}\">\\(A=(a_{ij})_{i,j\\in[n]}\\in\\Sigma^{n\\times n}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_n\">\\(S_n\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\">\\([n]\\)</span> 上的置换群，数值空乘积为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle b\\rangle\">\\(\\langle b\\rangle\\)</span> 为比特 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 的单字符字串。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{mat}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{mat}}\\)</span> 将一元维数与逐行矩阵位拼接，编码式中的字串乘积按行优先依次连接（空字串乘积为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(z\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{mat}}(A)\\coloneqq1^n0\\prod_{i=1}^n\\prod_{j=1}^n\\langle a_{ij}\\rangle\\quad(A\\in\\Sigma^{n\\times n},\\ n\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{mat}}(A)\\coloneqq1^n0\\prod_{i=1}^n\\prod_{j=1}^n\\langle a_{ij}\\rangle\\quad(A\\in\\Sigma^{n\\times n},\\ n\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{mat}}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{mat}}(A):n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ A\\in\\Sigma^{n\\times n}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{mat}}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{mat}}(A):n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ A\\in\\Sigma^{n\\times n}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{perm}_{0,1}(z)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\displaystyle\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S_n}\\prod_{i=1}^n a_{i,\\sigma(i)}&amp;z=\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{mat}}(A),\\ n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ A\\in\\Sigma^{n\\times n},\\\\0&amp;z\\in\\Sigma^*\\setminus\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{mat}}.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{perm}_{0,1}(z)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\displaystyle\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S_n}\\prod_{i=1}^n a_{i,\\sigma(i)}&amp;z=\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{mat}}(A),\\ n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ A\\in\\Sigma^{n\\times n},\\\\0&amp;z\\in\\Sigma^*\\setminus\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{mat}}.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{perm}_{0,1}\\in\\#\\mathbf P\\mathrm{Complete}_T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{perm}_{0,1}\\in\\#\\mathbf P\\mathrm{Complete}_T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>以置换为唯一编码证书，计数正好是二部图完美匹配数，给出 #P 成员关系。书中证明先构造有权图并从赋值数恢复永久式，再用模算术去掉负权、以小部件实现大整数权；最终 0/1 永久式的答案经多项式时间后处理恢复原值。因此这里明确使用函数图灵归约，未声称保持计数的 parsimonious 归约。旧文所说的“interpolation”不是该书本段采用的去负权步骤。已读证明文字；Figure 17.3 各部件的所有局部枚举未独立穷举。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Theorem 17.11，印刷页 347–351；PDF 页 373–377。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>R6证据边界：部件局部枚举及完整复杂度恢复证明尚未独立核验。本条可作为有明确来源限制的陈述记录，当前不作为已完成证明核验的依赖。\n修订说明：只假定编码可多项式时间解码不足以保证完全性归约可高效输出。现固定维数与逐行矩阵位的无填充单射编码；码长为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n^2+n+1\">\\(n^2+n+1\\)</span>，编解码均为多项式时间，空矩阵编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-sharp-p","status":"resolved","id":"9470641051e0a7af","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-sharp-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sharp-p-oracle","status":"resolved","id":"ed85cd72838ef590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-sharp-p-oracle]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sharp-p","status":"resolved","id":"9470641051e0a7af","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\#\\mathbf P$、$\\#\\mathbf P\\mathrm{Complete}_T$ 见 [[28-df-sharp-p]]、[[28-df-sharp-p-oracle]]。\n$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$A=(a_{ij})_{i,j\\in[n]}\\in\\Sigma^{n\\times n}$；$S_n$ 是 $[n]$ 上的置换群，数值空乘积为 $1$；$\\langle b\\rangle$ 为比特 $b$ 的单字符字串。$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{mat}}$ 将一元维数与逐行矩阵位拼接，编码式中的字串乘积按行优先依次连接（空字串乘积为 $\\varepsilon$）；$z\\in\\Sigma^*$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sharp-p-oracle","status":"resolved","id":"ed85cd72838ef590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\#\\mathbf P$、$\\#\\mathbf P\\mathrm{Complete}_T$ 见 [[28-df-sharp-p]]、[[28-df-sharp-p-oracle]]。\n$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$A=(a_{ij})_{i,j\\in[n]}\\in\\Sigma^{n\\times n}$；$S_n$ 是 $[n]$ 上的置换群，数值空乘积为 $1$；$\\langle b\\rangle$ 为比特 $b$ 的单字符字串。$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{mat}}$ 将一元维数与逐行矩阵位拼接，编码式中的字串乘积按行优先依次连接（空字串乘积为 $\\varepsilon$）；$z\\in\\Sigma^*$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\#\\mathbf P","display":false},{"tex":"\\#\\mathbf P\\mathrm{Complete}_T","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"A=(a_{ij})_{i,j\\in[n]}\\in\\Sigma^{n\\times n}","display":false},{"tex":"S_n","display":false},{"tex":"[n]","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle b\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{mat}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"z\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{mat}}(A)\\coloneqq1^n0\\prod_{i=1}^n\\prod_{j=1}^n\\langle a_{ij}\\rangle\\quad(A\\in\\Sigma^{n\\times n},\\ n\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{mat}}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{mat}}(A):n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ A\\in\\Sigma^{n\\times n}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{perm}_{0,1}(z)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\displaystyle\\sum_{\\sigma\\in S_n}\\prod_{i=1}^n a_{i,\\sigma(i)}&z=\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{mat}}(A),\\ n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ A\\in\\Sigma^{n\\times n},\\\\0&z\\in\\Sigma^*\\setminus\\mathcal E_{\\mathrm{mat}}.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{perm}_{0,1}\\in\\#\\mathbf P\\mathrm{Complete}_T.","display":true},{"tex":"n^2+n+1","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false}],"bytes":2964,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-110","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"算术电路：[[28-df-arithmetic-circuit]]、[[28-thm-schwartz-zippel]]、[[28-thm-valiant-permanent]]。"}],"outgoing":["9470641051e0a7af","ed85cd72838ef590"]}